prop rats creature.respawn=0
prop rats creature.zone=clerkyard
prop alpha creature.count=1
prop alpha creature.size=1.5
prop alpha creature.health=5
prop alpha creature.damage=2
prop alpha creature.respawn=0
prop alpha creature.zone=yard
prop alpha tint.color=#3a2e24
prop alpha tint.amount=0.6
prop pack creature.count=2
prop pack creature.respawn=0
prop pack creature.zone=yard

quest title=The Warden's Gate
quest intro=Utopia at last - and its summit fenced off by the warden. Make for the fenced summit and tie up at the docks below it.
step reach|docks|1|Make for the fenced hilltop and tie up at Utopia's docks below it
step read|Olof's last message|1|Read Olof's last message on the quay
step open|Olof's crate|1|Open Olof's covered crate under his message
step open|Empty cage|1|Look into the empty cage on the quay
step open|Fisherman's crate|1|Open the fisherman's covered crate by the cage
step open|Market stores|1|Search the market's stores under their cover
step pages||6|Check the trader's stack box by the bench: six pages for the journal
step open|Dock master's crate|1|Walk the pier to the dock master's crate at its end
step collect|story:dockkey|1|Take the dock master's key - the first of two
step reach|clerkyard|1|Cross to the prison clerk's desk by the prison house
step kill|Rat|3|Drive off the rats boiling out from under the prison house
step open|Prison clerk's desk|1|Search the prison clerk's gnawed desk
step collect|story:prisonkey|1|Take the prison clerk's key - the second
step pages||9|Look in the crate beside the clerk's desk: nine pages of Utopia so far
step reach|crewcamp|1|Go out to Olof's crew camp, a hut and tents on the far point
step read|Crew's journal|1|Read the crew's journal in their hut - the gate has a third lock
step reach|lighthouse|1|Climb Lighthouse Head, the hill with the old lighthouse mast
step open|Keeper's box|1|Climb the mast and open the keeper's box
step collect|story:keeperkey|1|Take the lighthouse keeper's key - the third
step reach|yard|1|Climb to the summit and unlock the warden's gate with all three keys
step kill|Hyena|3|Defeat the warden's hyenas and their alpha
step open|Warden's table|1|Go through the ledger on the warden's table
step open|Warden's pot|1|Search the pot in the corner of the warden's yard
step pages||12|Find the warden's jar by the palisade: twelve pages, the last before his chest
step open|Warden's chest|1|Open the warden's chest
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric|1|Take the electric zipline tool plans from the warden's chest
step blueprint|Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced|1|Take the advanced backpack plans from the warden's chest
step blueprint|Blueprint_TitaniumTools|1|Take the titanium tools plans from the warden's chest
quest done=The warden's chest opens on everything he hoarded: plans for an electric zipline, a big backpack, titanium tools. Below the summit, the docks are quiet, the sea wide open. Olof was right - it was meant for all of you. This is where Raft Remade's voyage ends: from the first radio tower's call to Utopia's last gate. Sail on - the sea has more islands than any map.
quest reward=TitaniumIngot*2;Plank*10;Rope*4

# --- A Raft store by the market: Utopia's last trader (Raft's goods, and plans the crew missed) --
store utopiashop at 38 32 ground

# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=30 n=1 seed=8806
prop treasure8806 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

# --- Raft's vehicles (VI4, 2026-10-23): parked on open ground, clear of paths and quest objects ---
place UT_ElectricityIsland_Crane02 - at -7 44 ground y=-1.0 sit scale=0.3 yaw=200

# --- RAFT REMADE 10-27: groundall - rocks the scatters/randomizer left off a slope or edge (CIGroundIslands): taken away by their
# bounds centre (the report's point; "body", as a rock's pivot can stand a metre or more off it)
clear at -34.59 39.26 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -4.44 -49.66 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -44.29 48.17 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -44.71 33.41 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder4
clear at -52.51 2.94 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -6.97 -46.68 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -60.07 -0.98 r=0.5 all body only=BigBoulder1_Low
clear at -62.66 4.63 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -75.57 12.49 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2
clear at -78.82 5.18 r=0.5 all body only=SmallBoulder2

save Utopia Remade
